,"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T12:26:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T12:32:01Z","body":"Don't ping random maintainers, if you want to bring attention to a PR just drop it in the contributors' chat, this will get reviewed when it can, it's the weekend, please have patience, this is not a critical major breaking issue, you can just use this change in your fork until this gets merged","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4018959859/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4019342149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117156#issuecomment-4019342149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117156","id":4019342149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vkktF","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T15:55:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T15:55:27Z","body":"> The master branch is a development branch where breakage is expected.\r\n\r\nThis is why I use the main branch. The tests for cl cannot cover all scenarios; someone needs to test with real projects. Especially for such simple errors, they shouldn't be left for other users to discover only after the stable version is released.\r\n\r\nBy the way, I noticed that the `linux-template-minimal` build for cl does not disable navigation. Otherwise, this issue should have been discovered earlier. Adding a navigation disable for the `linux-template-minimal` build isn't a complex change. Should I create a PR for it?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4019342149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4022896293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117156#issuecomment-4022896293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117156","id":4022896293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vyIal","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T10:56:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T10:56:35Z","body":"Thanks!\r\n\r\n> This is why I use the main branch. The tests for cl cannot cover all scenarios; someone needs to test with real projects. Especially for such simple errors, they shouldn't be left for other users to discover only after the stable version is released.\r\n\r\nThat's very valuable indeed as we can find such bugs during development and get them fixed thanks to your bleeding edge testing. My comment was just that while this is a great contribution in itself, being on the bleeding edge does imply such constraints that the master branch might have bugs, so if you also depend on it being production ready for your downstream work, that can clash with the upstream development process. So to be on the bleeding edge you need to accept to fix issues downstream if you rely on them being fixed in a given timeframe.\r\n\r\n> By the way, I noticed that the linux-template-minimal build for cl does not disable navigation. Otherwise, this issue should have been discovered earlier. Adding a navigation disable for the linux-template-minimal build isn't a complex change. Should I create a PR for it?\r\n\r\nYes that's a good idea, the minimal build should disable everything possible.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4022896293/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]